msgid "Save operations keep up to three rolling backups: sftpgo.json.bak, .bak.1 and .bak.2. The current file is replaced atomically after JSON validation."
msgstr "每次保存最多保留三份滚动备份：sftpgo.json.bak、.bak.1、.bak.2。JSON 校验通过后才会以原子 rename 方式替换当前文件。"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Service Settings"
msgstr "服务设置"

msgid "Status check error"
msgstr "状态检测出错"

msgid "The native SFTPGo configuration file is sftpgo.json inside this directory. The directory is kept in UCI for compatibility; edit the JSON rather than creating parallel UCI listener settings."
msgstr "此目录中的原生 SFTPGo 配置文件为 sftpgo.json。配置目录继续保留在 UCI 中以兼容旧版本；协议监听等设置请直接编辑 JSON，不要再建立重复的 UCI 配置。"

msgid "The native sftpgo.json could not be parsed. Open the Native Configuration page to fix it."
msgstr "原生 sftpgo.json 无法解析，请打开“SFTPGo 原生配置”页面修正。"

msgid "The previous LuCI version stored listener ports and database settings in /etc/config/sftpgo. The new version uses sftpgo.json for these values. Migrate once, then use only the native JSON configuration."
msgstr "旧版 LuCI 将监听端口和数据库设置存储在 /etc/config/sftpgo。新版本改为使用 sftpgo.json 保存这些值。迁移一次后，请只维护原生 JSON 配置。"

msgid "This is an OpenWrt bootstrap helper. It takes effect only while no administrator exists; all normal SFTPGo configuration stays in sftpgo.json."
msgstr "这是 OpenWrt 的首次引导辅助功能，仅在尚无管理员时生效；其他 SFTPGo 配置均保存在 sftpgo.json。"

msgid "This is the native SFTPGo configuration file. All fields documented by SFTPGo remain available here, including TLS certificates, SSH host keys, ACME, OIDC, MFA, KMS, SMTP, database providers, protocol bindings, security policies and Plugins."
msgstr "这里直接编辑 SFTPGo 原生配置文件。SFTPGo 文档中的全部字段都可以继续使用，包括 TLS 证书、SSH Host Key、ACME、OIDC、MFA、KMS、SMTP、数据库 provider、协议监听、安全策略和 Plugins。"

